# addAllFirst!

- _addAllFirst!(p, q)_

Add all the elements of the sequence _q_ to the start of the sequence _p_.
Answer _q_.

```
>>> let x = [4 5];
>>> let y = x.addAllFirst!([1 2 3]);
>>> (x, y)
([1 2 3 4 5], [1 2 3])
```

* * *

See also: addAll, addAllLast

